{"unit_id":"097794__dsh-subagent-model-notes#card-zh","repo":"097794/dsh-subagent-model-notes","commit":"48f74576f2c9f11f6a8e5345b487aee003ca32b3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-model-notes（DSH 网页插件）：为子代理可选模型维护逐模型说明，并帮助委派 Agent 根据任务选择合适的 provider/model。它在插件设置页列出模型目录、当前授权状态和已有说明，用户可编辑并保存；宿主侧读取当前会话的子代理模型授权路由，只把对应的非空说明追加到系统提示词中，并放在可选择模型的子代理工具指引旁。适合配置多个子代理模型、希望 Agent 按任务区分其用途的用户。需要在 DSH 插件设置中授权子代理模型并填写说明；不要求额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:53-68","lib/prompt.js:31-49","lib/client.js:584-607"]}
{"unit_id":"097794__dsh-subagent-model-notes#card-en","repo":"097794/dsh-subagent-model-notes","commit":"48f74576f2c9f11f6a8e5345b487aee003ca32b3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-subagent-model-notes is a DSH web plugin for per-model subagent guidance. Users edit notes beside the live model catalog and authorization state. For each session, it adds only notes matching authorized child routes to the prompt beside the delegation tool guidance. No extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:53-68","lib/prompt.js:31-49","lib/client.js:584-607"]}
